//                  an IoBuf's spare room, 'finish' to say the input is over.
//                  deflate's Inflater and Deflater and zstd's Decompressor and
//                  Compressor meet it.
//   Digester       a trait for what only consumes: 'feed' bytes in, 'finish'
//                  for the digest. cryptohash's Sha256, Sha512 and Sha1 meet it.
//   runAll, pullAll  the loop that drives any Transform: feed, finish, pull until it says
//                  something but MoreOutput; the output appended to a List (drive.cone)
