//                  lends them as one slice, 'consume(n)' uses them up (reader.cone).
//   Writer         buffers being filled: 'spare()', 'advance(n)', and 'take()'
//                  to hand the full buffer on; and the puts that build bytes and
//                  numbers ('put', 'putBE', 'putLE', slots, 'lengthPrefixedBE'),
