// The in-thread collector: a whole body gathered into a String, as its pieces
// arrive on the thread that owns the connection (an HTTP client's 'get', a server's
// request body). The producer and the consumer are the same thread, so a hop to an
// actor per piece would buy nothing; this is the plain helper that does the limit
